cts - Intervals.icu Forum","url":"https://forum.intervals.icu/t/subintervals-mobile-app-for-intervals-icu-data/78281?page=8"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"forum.intervals.icu","ref_id":"turn0search8","snippet":"My workout data syncs perfectly fine, but wellness/sleep data does not appear when I fetch it via the API (GET /athlete/{id}/wellness) unless I first manually","title":"Wellness data (sleep) only syncs from Zepp after manual web login - Uncategorized - Intervals.icu Forum","url":"https://forum.intervals.icu/t/wellness-data-sleep-only-syncs-from-zepp-after-manual-web-login/122754"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"forum.intervals.icu","ref_id":"turn0search9","snippet":"While trying to shift to OAuth, I have encountered an issue that might hit others as well: ... I added Activity: Write permission today but","title":"IcuSync - Claude AI MCP connector for Intervals.icu (no technical setup required) - Page 6 - AI Tools - Intervals.icu Forum","url":"https://forum.intervals.icu/t/icusync-claude-ai-mcp-connector-for-intervals-icu-no-technical-setup-required/126632?page=6"}]}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_19","type":"agent_message","text":"The provider’s documentation confirms the causes: `WRITE` already includes `READ` for a scope, and its OAuth tokens have no refresh-token flow or one-hour expiry. I’ll change Connect to start through the authenticated fetch wrapper, request each scope area once, and keep the access token until Intervals rejects it."}}
